  "description": "Kang Ha-Young's daily grind at her family-run SME is Overtime, overtime, overtime! Why does she have to do all the work...? Min Tae-Hun, a contract employee who could free her from the dreaded overtime, appears before her! But this employee seems suspicious...? Why did someone with such high specs come to our company? Huh? Is he gay? No, bi? Or maybe a womanizer!? They say you should avoid trouble, but she's curious about that man, Min Tae-Hun.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
